        "q": "What are the welcome benefits offered by SpiceJet Axis Bank Voyage Black Credit Card?",
        "a": "The card comes with a complimentary SpiceClub Gold Membership at the time of joining. Besides this, it also offers a SpiceJet voucher worth Rs. 4,000 on completing two transactions within 30 days of card approval."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can I redeem the rewards earned via SpiceJet Axis Bank Voyage Black Credit Card against cashback?",
        "a": "No, you can redeem the accumulated SpiceClub (SC) Points against SpiceJet flight tickets, meal vouchers, etc., via the SpiceJet mobile app or website."
      },
      {
        "q": "What is the forex markup fee charged by SpiceJet Axis Bank Voyage Black Credit Card?",
        "a": "SpiceJet Axis Bank Voyage Black Credit Card charges a forex markup fee of 3.5%. Therefore, this card is not a suitable option for international spends as it comes with a high forex markup fee. To save on international transactions, you can consider applying for a card with low or zero forex markup fees."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can I apply offline for SpiceJet Axis Bank Voyage Black Credit Card?",
        "a": "Yes, you can apply offline for this credit card by visiting any of the nearest Axis Bank branches and submitting the duly filled application form along with relevant documents in person. You can also apply online by visiting the official website of the bank and submitting the application form there."
